                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5cf29d6a-2d4f-39fd-ab38-9f5dd5eb9bc0",
                        "entry_id": "ead68fef-d77e-3ce3-8fcb-6a27cd543577",
                        "glosses": [
                            "exhaustion, weariness"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e13ae4e2-5a56-43e7-b75e-625c7d03e619",
                                "sense_id": "5cf29d6a-2d4f-39fd-ab38-9f5dd5eb9bc0",
                                "text": "Днём и по́зднею но́чью они́ одина́ково производи́ли впечатле́ние люде́й, куда́-то спеша́щих и че́м-то встрево́женных, ли́ца их, несмотря́ на кра́йнее изнеможе́ние, одина́ково бы́ли бодры́ и приве́тливы, го́лос ла́сков, движе́ния бы́стры…",
                                "translation": "By day or late at night they produced the same impression of men hastening somewhere and agitated by something, yet, in spite of their extreme exhaustion, their faces remained full of courage and kindly welcome, their voices friendly, their movements rapid. . . .",
                                "english": "By day or late at night they produced the same impression of men hastening somewhere and agitated by something, yet, in spite of their extreme exhaustion, their faces remained full of courage and kindly welcome, their voices friendly, their movements rapid. . . ."
                            }
                        ]
